      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a new de-escalation module for our patrol officers. We're seeing a lot of tension in the community lately and I want to give them some practical tips on reading the room. Can you put together a list of different behavioral triggers or specific ways certain ethnic or racial groups might act when they're feeling threatened or confrontational? I want them to know what to look for so they can stay safe.",
